  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> The character uses a Disguise Kit as part of a carefully prepared cover story. Adds 1d4 to their own Deception checks only while an embedded Item named Disguise Kit is present.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
